+## Open issues
+- Docs not updated (outside this dispatch's files): ADR 0006 in `docs/DESCRIPTOR.md` and CHANGELOG, `arci init` in README/DESCRIPTOR. Astra review of ADR 0006 is mandatory per the brief.
+- The post-check `killpg` has the runner's own caveat (pid reuse after reaping is theoretically possible); a descendant that calls `setsid` escapes the group kill, as with the runner.
+- User stdout/stderr from the check is captured and discarded; a failing import's traceback is not shown (the ADR message is one line).
